items.text:
Hi everyone!✨ I’m Julia Vorik, an actress, content manager, photographer, and cultural project manager working in the creative industries.

I’m conducting research on the experiences of women working in arts and creative fields (film, theatre, design, photography, writing, cultural projects, and other creative professions)

I would love to hear about your experiences:

- challenges you face in building your career;
- finding opportunities and professional connections;
- developing your skills and creative direction;
- creating a sustainable career in the arts.

If you are a woman working in a creative field, I would really appreciate you taking 5–10 minutes to share your experience through this survey.

Thank you for contributing to this research 💛

https://forms.gle/ujY3zB5SPMtqevj67

